# Face Detection Camera App

This project is a real-time face detection web application built using TensorFlow.js and the BlazeFace model.

## Features
- Uses webcam input
- Detects faces in real time
- Draws bounding boxes using HTML5 canvas
- Allows capturing screenshots

## Technologies
- HTML
- JavaScript
- TensorFlow.js
- BlazeFace Model

## How to Use
1. Open the app in a browser (Chrome recommended)
2. Click "Start Camera"
3. Allow camera access
4. The app will detect faces and display bounding boxes
5. Click "Screenshot" to capture the current frame

